---
import BaseLayout from '../layouts/BaseLayout.astro';
import { getUrl } from '../utils/nav';
---

<BaseLayout title="Home" description="Strategic portfolio and research practice">
  <main class="page-shell home-shell">
    <section class="hero-panel">
      <div class="hero-copy">
        <p class="eyebrow">Researcher • Strategist • Service Designer</p>
        <h1>I make complex systems easier to understand—and easier to change.</h1>
        <p class="lede">
          I’m a service designer and UX researcher working across research, strategy, and service design. I help teams understand what’s really happening, uncover opportunities, and turn complexity into clearer decisions and better ways of working.
        </p>
        <div class="hero-links">
          <a href={getUrl('/projects')}>View my work</a>
          <a href={getUrl('/about')}>About me</a>
          <a href={getUrl('/contact')}>Get in touch</a>
        </div>
      </div>
    </section>

    <section class="content-section services-section">
      <div class="section-label-wrap">
        <span class="section-mark">●</span>
        <p class="section-kicker">WHAT I DO</p>
      </div>
      <div class="services-intro">
        <h2>Research, strategy, and service design for problems that don’t come with simple answers.</h2>
        <p>
          I work where the problem is ambiguous, the system is complex, or the path forward isn’t obvious. My approach combines research and strategic thinking to make sense of what’s happening—and create a clearer way forward.
        </p>
      </div>
      <div class="service-list">
        <details class="service-item">
          <summary>
            <span class="service-summary">
              <span class="service-icon" aria-hidden="true">
                <svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.8" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"><circle cx="11" cy="11" r="6"></circle><line x1="16" y1="16" x2="21" y2="21"></line></svg>
              </span>
              <span class="service-title">Research &amp; Discovery</span>
            </span>
            <span class="toggle-indicator">+</span>
          </summary>
          <p>I uncover the needs, behaviors, motivations, and constraints that shape a problem.</p>
          <p class="service-note">Why it matters: The right insight can change the question before it changes the solution.</p>
        </details>

        <details class="service-item">
          <summary>
            <span class="service-summary">
              <span class="service-icon" aria-hidden="true">
                <svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.8" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"><path d="M3 12h18"></path><path d="M12 3v18"></path><path d="M4.5 4.5l15 15"></path><path d="M19.5 4.5l-15 15"></path></svg>
              </span>
              <span class="service-title">Service Design</span>
            </span>
            <span class="toggle-indicator">+</span>
          </summary>
          <p>I map the relationships between people, processes, products, and systems to understand how an experience actually works.</p>
          <p class="service-note">Why it matters: Seeing the whole service reveals opportunities that are easy to miss from a single touchpoint.</p>
        </details>

        <details class="service-item">
          <summary>
            <span class="service-summary">
              <span class="service-icon" aria-hidden="true">
                <svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.8" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"><path d="M4 18l7-7 3 3 7-7"></path><path d="M20 7h-5V2"></path><path d="M4 18h16"></path></svg>
              </span>
              <span class="service-title">Strategy &amp; Synthesis</span>
            </span>
            <span class="toggle-indicator">+</span>
          </summary>
          <p>I turn complex information into patterns, priorities, and direction that teams can use.</p>
          <p class="service-note">Why it matters: Research creates value when it helps people make better decisions.</p>
        </details>

        <details class="service-item">
          <summary>
            <span class="service-summary">
              <span class="service-icon" aria-hidden="true">
                <svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.8" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"><path d="M3 6l9 4 9-4-9-4-9 4z"></path><path d="M3 6v12l9 4 9-4V6"></path><path d="M12 10v12"></path></svg>
              </span>
              <span class="service-title">Journey Management</span>
            </span>
            <span class="toggle-indicator">+</span>
          </summary>
          <p>I develop frameworks and practices that help organizations understand, maintain, and act on customer journeys over time.</p>
          <p class="service-note">Why it matters: Journey thinking becomes more powerful when it becomes part of how an organization works.</p>
        </details>

        <details class="service-item">
          <summary>
            <span class="service-summary">
              <span class="service-icon" aria-hidden="true">
                <svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.8" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"><path d="M16 21v-2a4 4 0 0 0-4-4H7a4 4 0 0 0-4 4v2"></path><circle cx="9.5" cy="7" r="3.5"></circle><path d="M23 21v-2a4 4 0 0 0-3-3.87"></path><path d="M16 3.13a4 4 0 0 1 0 7.75"></path></svg>
              </span>
              <span class="service-title">Facilitation &amp; Alignment</span>
            </span>
            <span class="toggle-indicator">+</span>
          </summary>
          <p>I help teams make sense of complexity, challenge assumptions, and build shared understanding.</p>
          <p class="service-note">Why it matters: Progress is easier when the people making decisions have a shared view of the problem.</p>
        </details>

        <details class="service-item">
          <summary>
            <span class="service-summary">
              <span class="service-icon" aria-hidden="true">
                <svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.8" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"><path d="M4 7h16"></path><path d="M4 12h10"></path><path d="M4 17h16"></path><path d="M18 11l2 1-2 1"></path></svg>
              </span>
              <span class="service-title">Prioritization &amp; Decision Support</span>
            </span>
            <span class="toggle-indicator">+</span>
          </summary>
          <p>I create structured ways to evaluate opportunities, compare needs, and focus effort.</p>
          <p class="service-note">Why it matters: Clear criteria help teams move from a long list of possibilities to purposeful action.</p>
        </details>
      </div>
    </section>

    <section class="content-section projects-section">
      <div class="section-label-wrap">
        <span class="section-mark">●</span>
        <p class="section-kicker">Selected Work</p>
      </div>
      <div class="services-intro projects-intro">
        <h2>A selection of problems I’ve helped teams understand, navigate, and move forward.</h2>
        <p>
          My work spans service design, UX research, strategy, and organizational change—from improving complex internal processes to evaluating new concepts and understanding customer needs.
        </p>
      </div>
      <div class="work-grid">
        <a class="work-card" href={getUrl('/projects/enterprise-journey-management-practice')}>
          <div class="work-thumb thumb-1"></div>
          <div class="work-meta">
            <div class="work-topline">UX Research · Service Design · Strategy</div>
            <h3>Enterprise Journey Management</h3>
          </div>
        </a>
        <a class="work-card" href={getUrl('/projects/go-to-market-deal-making-process-overhaul')}>
          <div class="work-thumb thumb-2"></div>
          <div class="work-meta">
            <div class="work-topline">Research · Service Design · Strategy</div>
            <h3>Go-To-Market Process Overhaul</h3>
          </div>
        </a>
        <a class="work-card" href={getUrl('/projects/usps-mail-kiosks-bid-discovery')}>
          <div class="work-thumb thumb-3"></div>
          <div class="work-meta">
            <div class="work-topline">Discovery · Evaluation · Bid Support</div>
            <h3>USPS Mail Kiosks</h3>
          </div>
        </a>
        <a class="work-card" href={getUrl('/projects/branding-studio-mvp-validation')}>
          <div class="work-thumb thumb-4"></div>
          <div class="work-meta">
            <div class="work-topline">Concept Testing · Research · Validation</div>
            <h3>Branding Studio MVP Validation</h3>
          </div>
        </a>
      </div>
      <a class="all-link" href={getUrl('/projects')}>View all projects <span aria-hidden="true">→</span></a>
    </section>

    <section class="content-section journal-section">
      <div class="section-label-wrap">
        <span class="section-mark">●</span>
        <p class="section-kicker">How I Work</p>
      </div>
      <div class="services-intro">
        <h2>Start with the problem. Understand the system. Find the opportunity.</h2>
        <p>
          I’m less interested in jumping straight to solutions than in understanding what’s underneath the problem.
        </p>
        <p>
          That means looking beyond individual touchpoints to understand the people, processes, incentives, technology, and organizational realities shaping an experience.
        </p>
        <p>
          From there, I bring research and design together to create clarity—whether that means identifying an unmet need, reframing a problem, improving a process, or giving a team a better way to make decisions.
        </p>
      </div>
    </section>

    <section class="content-section cta-section">
      <div class="cta-panel compact-cta">
        <h2>Have a complicated problem worth understanding?</h2>
        <p>Let’s figure out what’s really happening—and what could happen next.</p>
        <a class="text-link" href={getUrl('/contact')}>Get in touch <span aria-hidden="true">→</span></a>
      </div>
    </section>
  </main>
</BaseLayout>
